    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d614">

                <pb facs="0729" n="1563" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1563"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 656.119/874</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Laughlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 13, 1918</hi></date>.] <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received 6.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3682. War Trade Board [from Sheldon]:</p>
                <p>No. 1858. It is proposed to have a clause in general agreement by which Dutch
                    Government will recognize N[etherlands] O[versea] T[rust] agreement. Would the
                    following clause cover what you had in mind in Department’s 1708, October 1,
                    your 1322, so that you would be willing to participate with the Allied
                    Governments in the N. O. T. agreements should same meet with your approval as
                    finally drafted? If not, what changes do you desire? Please rush reply.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>The Netherlands Government will recognize the [<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >and?</hi>] approve such agreement as may be made between British,
                        French and Italian Governments and the N. O. T. and also the participation
                        therein by the Government of the United States in such form as the
                        last-named Government may consider advisable. The Netherlands Government
                        undertakes that the existence of the N. O. T. shall continue during the
                        currency of this agreement.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laughlin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
